type: dataset
title: "Retrograde ephemeris: planetary stations, shadows and cazimi from JPL DE421"
abstract: "Minute-precise UTC times of retrograde and direct stations, pre-shadow and post-shadow boundaries, and Sun conjunctions or oppositions for Mercury through Pluto, 2024–2030, and every Mercury retrograde 1900–2050, computed with Skyfield from the JPL DE421 ephemeris."
